cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SPECTRUM SRA in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "SPECTRUM SRA: An Interactive Web Application for Systematic Review Automation"
abstract: "SPECTRUM SRA is an interactive web application that automates the systematic review pipeline, including search query generation for PubMed, Scopus, and Web of Science, deduplication, dual-reviewer screening with Cohen's Kappa, PRISMA 2020 diagram generation, and LLM-assisted data extraction."
